OL,3,AXi and Trump tout friendship between US
OL,4,Aand China in state dinner speeches
OL,5,
OL,6,FDonald Trump and First Lady Melania
OL,7,Fwelcome Xi Jinping and his wife Peng
OL,8,FLiyuan to the White House for a state
OL,9,Fdinner
OL,11,FIn his remarks at the dinner, Xi urges
OL,12,Ffor a "new approach" for China and the
OL,13,FUS to act as responsible global powers
OL,14,Fin a changing world
OL,16,FIn his remarks, Trump gifts Xi a statue
OL,17,Fof a bald eagle and says they have
OL,18,F"never gotten along better", he also
OL,19,Fsays he will show those in attendance
OL,20,Fthe under-construction White House
OL,21,Fballroom after dinner
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
