OL,3,AXi and Trump tout friendship between US
OL,4,Aand China in state dinner speeches
OL,5,
OL,6,FWho has a seat at the table? Big tech
OL,7,Fbosses are attending, including Tesla's
OL,8,FElon Musk, Apple's Tim Cook, OpenAI's
OL,9,FSam Altman and Nvidia's Jensen Huang
OL,11,FEarlier, Trump said he and Xi had made
OL,12,F"tremendous strides on the issues
OL,13,Ffacing our two countries"; Xi,
OL,14,Fmeanwhile, said he hoped "Chinese
OL,15,Fcompanies are treated fairly here"
